  "notes": "K to 12 basic education: Kindergarten (excluded here), Grades 1-6 elementary, Grades 7-10 Junior High School, Grades 11-12 Senior High School. The PQF also splits elementary into primary (K-Grade 3) and intermediate (Grades 4-6). The aliases for Grades 7-10 are the pre-K to 12 high-school year names. The MATATAG curriculum is being phased in from SY 2024-2025; Senior High School has its own schedule."
